### Регистрация
POST http://localhost:8080/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user@gmail.com",
  "password": "password",
  "firstName": "Ivan",
  "lastName": "Ivanov",
  "phone": "+7 (999) 123-45-67",
  "role": "USER"
}

### Вход
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user@gmail.com",
  "password": "password"
}

### Все объявления
GET http://localhost:8080/ads

### Объявления текущего пользователя
GET http://localhost:8080/ads/me
Authorization: Basic user@gmail.com password

### Профиль
GET http://localhost:8080/users/me
Authorization: Basic user@gmail.com password

### Обновить профиль
PATCH http://localhost:8080/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic user@gmail.com password

{
  "firstName": "Ivan",
  "lastName": "Ivanov",
  "phone": "+7 (999) 123-45-67"
}

### Сменить пароль
POST http://localhost:8080/users/set_password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic user@gmail.com password

{
  "currentPassword": "password",
  "newPassword": "password1"
}

### Комментарии объявления
GET http://localhost:8080/ads/1/comments
Authorization: Basic user@gmail.com password
